sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>8321/TCP HTTP
    participant Auth as OAuth2 JWT Validator
    participant IdP as OAuth2 Identity Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant vLLM as vLLM Backend<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant VDB as Vector DB<br/>(Milvus/PGVector/Qdrant)

    Note over OGX: Startup: entrypoint.sh resolves<br/>_FILE secrets from K8s mounts

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Inference Request Flow
        Client->>OGX: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>
        OGX->>Auth: Validate token
        Auth->>IdP: Fetch JWKS keys<br/>HTTPS/443
        IdP-->>Auth: JWKS response
        Auth-->>OGX: Token valid (user identity)
        OGX->>vLLM: Proxy inference request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS (TLS verify configurable)
        vLLM-->>OGX: Completion response
        OGX->>PG: Persist conversation/response<br/>SQL store
        PG-->>OGX: Write confirmed
        OGX-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,VDB: RAG Flow (when vector_io configured)
        Client->>OGX: POST /v1/responses<br/>with file context
        OGX->>Auth: Validate token
        Auth-->>OGX: Token valid
        OGX->>VDB: Query similar documents<br/>(HTTP/gRPC, mTLS configurable)
        VDB-->>OGX: Relevant document chunks
        OGX->>vLLM: Inference with retrieved context
        vLLM-->>OGX: Augmented response
        OGX->>PG: Persist results
        PG-->>OGX: Write confirmed
        OGX-->>Client: RAG-augmented response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Client,OGX: Anthropic Messages API
        Client->>OGX: POST /v1/messages<br/>Anthropic Messages format
        OGX->>Auth: Validate token
        Auth-->>OGX: Token valid
        OGX->>vLLM: Proxy inference
        vLLM-->>OGX: Completion
        OGX->>PG: Persist
        PG-->>OGX: Confirmed
        OGX-->>Client: Messages API response
    end
